<title>UK: Sal Oppenheim sets warrants on sterling/mark.</title>
<headline>Sal Oppenheim sets warrants on sterling/mark.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sal Oppenheim jr &amp; Cie said it has issued call and put warrants of 500,000 per series on sterling/mark.</p>
<p>The warrants mature between December 4, 1997 and September 3, 1998. Payment date is July 11, 1997 and they are listed on the Duesseldorf and Frankfurt stock exchanges. The warrants are available in minimum exercise lots of 100. --Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
